- **`normalizeAddress` / `canonicalAddress`** (341-368): trims, collapses whitespace, upper-cases, expands `ST→STREET, RD→ROAD, AVE→AVENUE`.
- **`normalizeTelephone` / `toE164` / `matchCountryCode`** (381-430): converts to E.164. Assumes `+61` when no country code, drops a leading `0`, strips non-digits; requires 8–15 digits; enforces per-country national length (`+1`→10, `+61`→9 via `COUNTRY_NATIONAL_LENGTH`, lines 99-100). Invalid → `InvalidOwnerFieldsException(["telephone"])` (400).
